  "contentval": "0004Izzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/266",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2e18f02f2ca57d8d49ab91f02bbeee690cbc75c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2e18f02f2ca57d8d49ab91f02bbeee690cbc75c2\" data-origin-width=\"637\" data-origin-height=\"349\"></div><p><b>1.&#160;퀴네&#160;발효관으로&#160;실험시&#160;문제점 </b><br>&#160; 1) 기체 발생량이 적을 경우 측정의 어려움 <br>&#160; 2) 기체가 발생할 때까지 오랜 시간이 걸림 <br>&#160; 3) 솜으로 막은 입구 쪽으로 효모 용액이 흘러 넘침</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7efc50bc2e5195bf223b71cf38188ba7afa5cb86\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7efc50bc2e5195bf223b71cf38188ba7afa5cb86\" data-origin-width=\"829\" data-origin-height=\"895\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그럼&#160;이&#160;실험키트로&#160; <br>1시간&#160;동안&#160;어떻게&#160;탐구실험을&#160;해볼까?&#160;를&#160;고민하였습니다.</p><p><br><b>3. 효모의 알콜발효에 영향을 미치는 요인</b>(조건)을 함께 찾아보고, <br>&#160;&#160;모둠별로&#160;1개&#160;주제만&#160;탐구하도록&#160;해당&#160;가설을&#160;작성함&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93db07e6bd91cd9a3e34d47ab8695df9f5f45948\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93db07e6bd91cd9a3e34d47ab8695df9f5f45948\" data-origin-width=\"642\" data-origin-height=\"294\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>4. 실험장치의 원리를 이해하고, 실험장치를 꾸미는 시간이 오래 걸림 </b><br>&#160;&#160;--&gt;&#160;중요한&#160;실험장치&#160;사진들을&#160;제공하여&#160;실험설계의&#160;이해도를&#160;높임</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37512130ced313b24054bc25dc8ea7343477bfa4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37512130ced313b24054bc25dc8ea7343477bfa4\" data-origin-width=\"743\" data-origin-height=\"579\"></div><p><b>&#160;5. 해당 실험을 위한 재료가 들어있는 바구니를 나눠줌</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54daabb989675507b5092818447cc3290cb8554f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54daabb989675507b5092818447cc3290cb8554f\" data-origin-width=\"350\" data-origin-height=\"378\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b>6. 바구니의&#160;재료들을&#160;참고하여&#160;모둠별로&#160;실험&#160;계획&#160;세우기&#160;</b></p><p>&#160;계획 작성 완료되면 손들어 지도교사에게 확인 받고 실험 수행~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0c2f750989ce349db5aa56805586f71b14603b8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0c2f750989ce349db5aa56805586f71b14603b8\" data-origin-width=\"528\" data-origin-height=\"392\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>탐구실험 보고서는&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/989a009b747b6f053123fb869acbd5c0bbc0f21a?download\" data-file-name=\"발효 탐구실험 보고서(김영학).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"125914\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D266%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20260520125554&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F989a009b747b6f053123fb869acbd5c0bbc0f21a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">발효 탐구실험 보고서(김영학)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">122.96KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>실험 결과 분석은 2차시에~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
